# PROOF-02 (measure/windows): raw-startapps.json is a full personal-machine
# software inventory (every Get-StartApps row + every installed AppX
# package) with absolute paths embedding the OS username. Never committed —
# only the derived, redacted uwp-scan-result.json is. See docs/adr/0002.
measure/windows/proof-02/**/raw-startapps.json
# Default scratch output dir for repeated/dev runs of uwp-enum.mjs — the
# committed snapshot lives in measure/windows/proof-02/out/ and is only
# updated via an explicit `--out measure/windows/proof-02/out` re-record.
measure/windows/proof-02/.scratch/

# PROOF-03 (measure/windows): default, untracked, timestamped destination
# for proof-03-lnk-benchmark.mjs report runs. The tracked canonical
# baseline is measure/windows/proof-03-results.json, only overwritten via
# an explicit `--write-canonical` re-record. See docs/adr/0003, round-9
# blocker finding 4.
measure/windows/out/
ios/Dokke.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
